        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on current issues and agree on scope and priorities for the upgrade.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 297341,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's kick off the 'Cross-Depot Safe Handling and Loading Process Upgrade' project. To get started on T1, can everyone share the biggest pain points you face daily with loading, packing, and finding things in the depots? Let's get it all on the table.",
            "mentions": [
              18459,
              38045,
              59367,
              66233,
              265520
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "wave",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 59367,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "The labels on the shelves are confusing. Sometimes the code doesn't match what's on the box.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 38045,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "I'd say the biggest issue is inconsistent packing. We get fragile items in flimsy boxes, and they often get crushed when we have to stack things to fit in the truck. Also, heavy items are sometimes put on top of lighter ones.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "point_up",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 18459,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Sometimes the boxes are just too heavy for one person. Are there rules for that?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 66233,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Good points. From a depot perspective, the main problem is the lack of a clear staging area. Movers leave returns anywhere, which blocks access for picking new loads. This disorganization is a major source of delays and misplaced items. It also makes it hard to keep track of what's damaged, which messes with our numbers in A6.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "clipboard",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 297341,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "Thanks, everyone. That's a solid list. It sounds like the recurring themes are:\n1. Inconsistent packing causing damage.\n2. Disorganized depot layout leading to delays and errors.\n3. Unclear labeling and handling rules.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 297341,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "I propose we prioritize these three as our main focus. This seems to cover the biggest risks to safety and efficiency. Does everyone agree?",
            "mentions": [
              18459,
              38045,
              59367,
              66233,
              265520
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 38045,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Works for me. Those are the big ones.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 66233,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Agreed. That gives us a clear focus.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
