      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Define and validate the depot storage layout and labelling approach.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 66233,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "All, here is the proposed depot storage layout and shelf map (A3) for the pilot at Central Depot. This is the first step for T4. I've focused on creating clear zones: Inbound/Returns, Staging for Outbound, Bulky Items, and Fragile/High-Value. The labelling scheme uses Aisle-Bay-Level (e.g., A01-03-B). Feedback is welcome.",
            "mentions": [
              18459,
              38045,
              59367,
              297341,
              265520
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "🗺️",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M33",
            "speaker_id": 59367,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "That's a lot of zones. Seems complicated.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 38045,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "I like the idea of a dedicated staging area. Will the fast-moving items be stored close to it?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 66233,
            "reply_to": "M34",
            "text": "Exactly. The layout puts the highest frequency items in the bays closest to the staging area to minimize travel time. The zones might seem like a lot at first, @59367, but they prevent the chaos we have now. Clear signs will be posted.",
            "mentions": [
              59367,
              38045
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 297341,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "This is excellent, @66233. Very clear and logical. The Aisle-Bay-Level system is standard and easy to learn. My only suggestion: can we make the staging area lanes one-way to improve flow and prevent cart traffic jams?",
            "mentions": [
              66233
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "👍",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 66233,
            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "Great idea, @297341. A one-way flow is a simple change that would significantly improve safety and efficiency. I'll update the map in A3 to include that. I'll also add floor markings to the plan.",
            "mentions": [
              297341
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 18459,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "What about things that need to be kept cold?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 66233,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "That's a separate refrigerated section and not part of this general storage layout change, but it's a good question. We'll ensure the signage to that area is also clear.",
            "mentions": [
              18459
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 66233,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "With the one-way flow added, are we ready to approve this layout and labelling scheme for the pilot at Central Depot? This will be our plan for T9 adjustments after we get feedback.",
